[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_02_0010","text":"朝日——？差不多该去拍摄了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_02_0020","text":"……？\n我进来了哦？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_02_0030","text":"呼……呼……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_02_0040","text":"啊，朝日……\n醒醒"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_02_0050","text":"嗯……唔……\n咦？　Producer先生……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_02_0060","text":"马上要拍摄了哦\n话说回来朝日……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_02_0070","text":"穿着衣服躺在地上可不行吧……！\n会起皱的，不是吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_02_0080","text":"啊——……说得也是"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_02_0090","text":"你看，我整理好了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_02_0100","text":"嗯〜……好吧，看起来没问题了\n────来吧，拍摄，加油吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11700200_02_0101","text":"Motion"}]
